cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use any Tri Language discoveries, please cite our defensive publication."
title: "Tri Language: Linear Types, Effects, Dual-Target Code Generation"
abstract: "This bundle presents Trinity's Tri language, a pure Zig DSL for hardware-software co-design, featuring Linear Types with ownership modes (Let, Inout, Sink, Set) for resource safety, Algebraic Effects with Handlers for platform-aware error handling, Bit/Trit-level pattern matching for hardware optimization, Content-Addressed Functions using SHA256 AST hashing for reproducible builds, Austral-style Result Type for exception-free error handling, Array Combinators (map, filter, fold) for functional programming, and Pipe Operator for chaining operations. Includes VIBEE compiler components: Ternary JSON Parser (3-valued, 100M ops/s), Coptic Code Generation (T27 bytecode), Memory-Tiered Inference (Hippocampus), and VIBEE Benchmark Suite. All innovations published as defensive prior art with Zenodo DOIs."
